> MAST 663 Decision Tools for Policy Analysis
> MAST 664 Environmental Issue Capstone
> 
> A student may write an analytical paper in lieu of the capstone experience, with the approval of an SMSP or SMSP-affiliated faculty member one year prior to graduation. The analytical paper is an article-length paper targeting publication in an environmental economics or policy journal.
> 
> Analytical Paper
> MAST 865 Analytical Paper
> Other relevant course at the graduate level as approved by the advisor. See
> examples below. 
