> Economics Electives (18 cr - minimum) 
> Eighteen credits of economic courses distributed as follows: 
> • Three courses (9 cr) at or above the 300-level 
> o Credit only for one of: ECON 251, ECON 255, ECON 300, or ECON 301 o Only one of the following courses: ECON 303 or ECON 304 is allowed o Credit will not be allowed for both courses of any of the following sets: ▪ ECON 332 and ECON 433 
> ▪ ECON 343 and ECON 444 
